    "detailed_description": "<strong>A Third/First Person, Roleplaying Adventure game set in the not-so-distant future that contains puzzles, flying cars, robot warfare, upgradeable weapons and exploration. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game is a WIP (work in progress) and THIS Build (2.0) shows you the world and some of the vehicles, weapons and characters that you'll be using.</h2> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140460/extras/667443214a07a7ed04353d8ad90c9290.avif?t=1701310948\" /></div><br>\u2014----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><strong>Current State - Alpha 3.0</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large Map with Multiple points of Interest<br></li><li>Scanning System</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic Weather Interactions (Footprints in Sand, Water interaction, Snow, Fauna, Animals)<br></li><li>Weapon Systems (Aiming, Selection, Upgrades, Destruction)<br></li><li>Vehicle Driving Systems <br></li><li>Inventory System<br></li><li>Save Game / Bags Controller<strong>Next Update: ALPHA 3.1</strong><br><br><strong>Systems we hope to implement for 3.0 -</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Voxel Integration (Landscape and Weapons)<br></li><li>Mac Integration<br></li><li>NPC Interaction, Quest System, Character dialog and Skill tree <br></li><li>First Five Quests<br></li><li>Train Interaction with Location Stops<br></li><li>VR Integration<br></li><li>Android Integration<br></li><li>Vehicle Weapon Upgrades and Maintenance Cycles</li></ul></li><li>3d Map with Points of Interest and Fog of War</li></ul><br>In <strong>Q2 2023</strong>, I plan to release 4-5 Missions <br>per update!<br><br>For now, please enjoy!<br><br>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>A Third/First Person, Roleplaying Adventure game set in the not-so-distant future that contains puzzles, flying cars, robot warfare, upgradeable weapons and exploration. </strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This game is a WIP (work in progress) and THIS Build (2.0) shows you the world and some of the vehicles, weapons and characters that you'll be using.</h2> <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140460/extras/667443214a07a7ed04353d8ad90c9290.avif?t=1701310948\" /></div><br>\u2014----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br><br><strong>Current State - Alpha 3.0</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large Map with Multiple points of Interest<br></li><li>Scanning System</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic Weather Interactions (Footprints in Sand, Water interaction, Snow, Fauna, Animals)<br></li><li>Weapon Systems (Aiming, Selection, Upgrades, Destruction)<br></li><li>Vehicle Driving Systems <br></li><li>Inventory System<br></li><li>Save Game / Bags Controller<strong>Next Update: ALPHA 3.1</strong><br><br><strong>Systems we hope to implement for 3.0 -</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Voxel Integration (Landscape and Weapons)<br></li><li>Mac Integration<br></li><li>NPC Interaction, Quest System, Character dialog and Skill tree <br></li><li>First Five Quests<br></li><li>Train Interaction with Location Stops<br></li><li>VR Integration<br></li><li>Android Integration<br></li><li>Vehicle Weapon Upgrades and Maintenance Cycles</li></ul></li><li>3d Map with Points of Interest and Fog of War</li></ul><br>In <strong>Q2 2023</strong>, I plan to release 4-5 Missions <br>per update!<br><br>For now, please enjoy!<br><br>",
    "short_description": "***Early Access*** A third Person Roleplaying Adventure game set in the not-so-distant future that contains puzzles, flying cars, robot warfare, upgradeable weapons and exploration. Early Access Purchase includes full game when it becomes available.",
